# Elemental Gearbolt (USA) SLUS-00654

[No Gun Flash]
Type = Gameshark
Activation = EndFrame
Author = Bratwurstmensch
Description = Removes the bright white screen flashes when firing by reducing the flash overlay to a single pixel in height. Unlike the original Nuvee patch, this preserves the rendering call and greatly reduces the noticeable stuttering during rapid fire. A brief pause in camera movement may still be visible when shooting, as the game temporarily skips normal scene rendering during flash frames.
